From bde560207d59494852a6f2ce9f45e3045bef1685 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christoph Berliner <32103696+Styx85@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:53:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rocblas: add an MT96x96x16 HHS_BH TN solution for gfx90c

Append one Tensile solution (MT96x96x16, TT6x6, WG16x16, DepthU 16,
NLCA/NLCB 1, PGR/PLR 1; found with configurations from oto,
https://github.com/Netherquark/oto) to Cijk_Alik_Bljk_HHS_BH as solution
70 and select it for the Whisper large-v3 encoder shapes 1280x1500x1280,
5120x1500x1280 and 1280x1500x5120.

rocblas-bench on gfx90c (5600G), alternating old/new library: 3.37 ->
3.20 ms, 12.87 -> 12.37 ms, 13.84 -> 12.88 ms; results validated.
PyTorch Whisper large-v3-turbo with TunableOp re-tuned for each library:
encoder 3072 -> 2990 ms, identical transcription.

Note: appending a solution shifts the global rocBLAS solution indices of
later tables, so PyTorch TunableOp files must be regenerated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
